 #27 and #28 (both validated), what nuaa_bn_recalibration.load_inputs reads (the same M2 manifests, cache and extracted frames file, loaded whole, the cells run, the status.json, restricted SHA256SUMS and extracted_frames.csv of the folds run, the revised note of PR #27, the architecture file, and of the parent run at patience 4 status.json, both SHA256SUMS, its public aggregate.json only as bytes for the SHA-256 (it holds test metrics, never parsed), and per model card, dev scores, threshold and checkpoint), of the run 20261114-BNRECAL-a10a082 what nuaa_bn_test.load_bnrecal reads (status.json, both SHA256SUMS, public results.csv and run_record.json, restricted public_SHA256SUMS.sha256, per model _scores.csv and _bn_statistics.json, which hold dev and fitting rows only); it assembles only fitting and dev frames. No command loads the fold schema (fold<k>_test.csv) or opens a <model>_test_scores.csv"
